{"name":"Zalviger","size":"medium","type":"Fiend","tag":"","alignment":"lawful evil","hitDice":"11","armorName":"other","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":2,"otherArmorDesc":"19 (scale mail)","speed":"30","burrowSpeed":"0","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"60","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"0","customHP":false,"customSpeed":false,"hpText":"66 (12d8 + 12)","speedDesc":"30 ft., fly 60 ft.","strPoints":"18","dexPoints":"18","conPoints":"16","intPoints":"14","wisPoints":"12","chaPoints":"16","blindsight":"0","blind":false,"darkvision":"60","tremorsense":"0","truesight":"0","telepathy":60,"cr":"5","customCr":"4 (1,100 XP)","customProf":2,"isLegendary":false,"legendariesDescription":"The succubus/incubus can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The succubus/incubus regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, the succubus/incubus can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), the succubus/incubus can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:","lairDescriptionEnd":"The succubus/incubus can't repeat an effect until they have all been used, and it can't use the same effect two rounds in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the succubus/incubus's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the succubus/incubus's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the succubus/incubus dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[{"name":"Fiendish Blesshing","desc":"The AC of the cambion includes its Charisma bonus."},{"name":"Innate Spellcasting","desc":"The [MON]'s innate spellcasting ability is Charisma (spell save DC [CHA SAVE], [CHA ATK] to hit with spell attacks). It can innately cast the following spells, requiring no material components:\n\n> 3/day each: _alter self, command, detect magic_\n> 1/day each: _plane shift_ (self only)"}],"actions":[{"name":"Multiattack","desc":"The [MON] makes two attacks with its falchion."},{"name":"Falchion","desc":"_Melee Weapon Attack:_ [STR ATK + 1] to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. _Hit:_ [STR 1D10 + 1] slashing damage and [2d4] fire damage."},{"name":"Fire Ray","desc":"_Ranged Spell Attack:_ [CHA ATK] to hit, range 120 ft., one target. _Hit:_ [CHA 3D6] fire damage."},{"name":"Fiendish Charm","desc":"One humanoid the cambion can see within 30 feet of it must succeed on a DC 14 Wisdom saving throw or be magically charmed for 1 day. The charmed target obeys the cambion's spoken commands. If the target suffers any harm from the cambion or another creature or receives a suicidal command from the cambion, the target can repeat the saving throw, ending the effect on itself on a success. If a target's saving throw is successful, or if the effect ends for it, the creature is immune to the cambion's Fiendish Charm for the next 24 hours."}],"bonusActions":[],"reactions":[],"legendaries":[],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[{"name":"str","order":0},{"name":"con","order":2},{"name":"int","order":3},{"name":"cha","order":5}],"skills":[{"name":"deception","stat":"cha"},{"name":"intimidation","stat":"cha"},{"name":"perception","stat":"wis"},{"name":"stealth","stat":"dex"}],"damagetypes":[{"name":"cold","note":" (Resistant)","type":"r"},{"name":"fire","note":" (Resistant)","type":"r"},{"name":"lightning","note":" (Resistant)","type":"r"},{"name":"poison","note":" (Resistant)","type":"r"}],"specialdamage":[{"name":"bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing from nonmagical attacks","note":" (Resistant)","type":"r"}],"conditions":[],"languages":[{"name":"Abyssal","speaks":true},{"name":"Common","speaks":true},{"name":"Infernal","speaks":true}],"understandsBut":"","shortName":"","pluralName":"","doubleColumns":false,"separationPoint":5,"damage":[]}